421
00:23:11,319 --> 00:23:12,680
onto our Cheng family

422
00:23:12,759 --> 00:23:14,039
and Gufeng

423
00:23:15,599 --> 00:23:16,880
won't be that easy.

424
00:23:18,599 --> 00:23:19,119
Exactly,

425
00:23:19,119 --> 00:23:19,839
Grandma.

426
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:32,759
The recent events at the company...

427
00:23:33,519 --> 00:23:34,799
I'm sure everyone has heard.

428
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:39,000
President An.

429
00:23:39,519 --> 00:23:41,559
We were also deceived by Lin Wanmei.

430
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:42,960
As for holding people accountable,

431
00:23:43,119 --> 00:23:44,359
I won't say any more on it.

432
00:23:44,759 --> 00:23:46,160
I hope that from now on,

433
00:23:46,519 --> 00:23:47,799
