449
00:24:26,559 --> 00:24:27,960
The company's image comes first.

450
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:28,480
Yeah.

451
00:24:28,599 --> 00:24:29,519
Yeah, President Lin.

452
00:24:29,960 --> 00:24:30,559
Just consider it

453
00:24:30,640 --> 00:24:31,359
taking a vacation.

454
00:24:33,200 --> 00:24:34,000
Take some time to relax.

455
00:24:34,160 --> 00:24:34,960
Fine.

456
00:24:36,039 --> 00:24:37,039
You're all just great.

457
00:24:44,839 --> 00:24:46,319
Why is she back?

458
00:24:48,599 --> 00:24:49,359
Right now,

459
00:24:49,480 --> 00:24:51,279
